      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JOCK FROM IBROX (1) is progressing well with another good run, placing by 2 lengths (30.04) in a Grade 5 at The Gardens. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. Well-placed to take this out. BEES HIVE (5) was below best at her last start when 8th at Wentworth Park following a third place finish (29.97) at this track two back. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. MISS JACK HIGH (2) produced a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 515m behind King Kermaro (30.35) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Leading chance. HELLO SHELLY (4) drops in journey and warrants respect.",
